      "content": "\"On my own terms\"... that's a heavy thought. You're talking about agency, aren't you? That if the work is done, the only thing left is the choice of how it all concludes. It almost sounds like you're suggesting that there is a certain grace in choosing when the story ends, rather than just letting it fade away into nothingness.",
